    {
      "heading": "A new score at the gold line",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-26-1759-arc-2-lashen-learning-takes-gold-place"
      ],
      "text": "Lashen Learning closes sixteenth at 69.44, up two places and 2.91 points since the previous close. It takes the last of sixteen provisional gold places. ảc sits seventeenth at 69.17, just 0.27 points below the line; ARC Raiders drops from sixteenth to eighteenth with its score unchanged at 68.75. The gold score has risen from 68.75 to 69.44."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The leading trio holds its ground",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-26-1200-arc-2-domdolus-tolus-moves-into-third"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs leads on 88.06, followed by Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model at 84.72 and Domdolus Tolus at 82.08. Those scores and ranks are unchanged from the previous evening close. The midday wire’s report that Domdolus Tolus advanced from fifth to third used an earlier rolling baseline; it is not a fresh gain during this edition’s daily comparison. Nvbanana remains fourth on 81.39 and rabbithole fifth on 80.83."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The chase spreads through the field",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-26-0757-arc-2-nischay-dhankhar-climbs-from-503rd-to-48th",
        "wire-2026-10-26-0956-arc-2-richard-freinschlag-surges-into-top-hundred",
        "wire-2026-10-26-1401-arc-2-trian-climbs-to-thirty-eighth",
        "wire-2026-10-26-1557-arc-2-megsub-rises-to-sixty-seventh"
      ],
      "text": "Mtg reaches twenty-second at 65.83, up eight places and 3.75 points. Flying Pandas closes twenty-sixth at 65.14, up three places and 2.08 points. Nguyen, team 16600664, rises thirteen places to thirty-fourth at 58.19; that is a separate entry from team 17166527, now displayed as ảc. Trian gains eleven places to thirty-eighth on 55.14 and Rick eleven places to fortieth on 54.86. The earlier wire separately reported Nischay Dhankhar reaching 49.72, Richard Freinschlag reaching 37.08 and megsub reaching 41.25; those rolling-window advances are not additional closing gains."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Methods remain an open reporting assignment",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Arshjot Khehra holds forty-fifth at 52.50, unchanged from the previous close. The editor’s follow-up on Khehra and the entry previously reported as Thanh Hau Nguyen remains open: the saved evidence establishes standings, but does not establish their methods. Social and discussion research was not refreshed for this edition, and no fresh notebook or repository inspection was conducted. The board now contains 3,380 teams; its medal places remain provisional."
